---
// Empty on purpose: the light / dark switch lives in the bottom taskbar on every page (SPEC D31,
// src/components/taskbar/Taskbar.astro). It keeps Starlight's state (data-theme, localStorage
// `starlight-theme`); ThemeProvider.astro still applies it before first paint, dark unless chosen (D9).
---

<style>
	/* Starlight's header draws a divider after its social icons, before the theme picker. With neither
	   (no social links are configured), the divider would stand alone. */
	:global(.header .social-icons:empty)::after {
		display: none;
	}
</style>
